Company overview_en:
Speed - Responsibility - Proactiveness - Creativity
VISION
- A leading company providing information technology, telecommunications and data processing products and services in the aviation, tourism and travel sectors in Cambodia, Laos, Myanmar and Vietnam.
MISSION
- Provide the best IT, telecommunications and data processing products and services to customers in general and to Vietnam Airlines Corporation (JSC) in particular;
- Accompany customers, become a trusted partner and develop sustainably.
- Balance the common interests of the company, customers, shareholders, employees and society.
- Trust, Safety, Quality, Efficiency;
- Customer-centric;
- Employees are the most valuable asset;
- Digital technology and data processing are vital.
AITS aims to develop high-quality IT human resources.
In 2021 the company needs to recruit 48 IT specialists for projects of the company and of Vietnam Airlines.

